# No Auto-Commit

- **Never** create a git commit unless the user explicitly asks in this conversation (e.g. «کامیت کن», «commit», «create a commit»).
- Generating a commit **message** (skill `cz`) is allowed; running `git commit` is not, unless they asked to commit.
- Do not stage+commit as a “helpful” follow-up after finishing a task.
